  "description": "In an era where only married women could inherit, she is hastily wed before her father goes to war. Her husband leaves for battle as well, and years pass before he returns as a celebrated hero. As they slowly grow closer during their uneasy life together, a supposed “corpse of her husband” suddenly arrives. Realizing the man beside her lacks even the basic knowledge her real husband possessed, she begins to question everything especially whether the person claiming to be her husband is truly who he says he is.\nSource: MU",
